","sm":"Lamanā."}]},{"en":"And now, in your epistle you have censured me, but it mattereth not; I am not angry, but do rejoice in the greatness of your heart. I, Pahoran, do not seek for power, save only to retain my judgment-seat that I may preserve the rights and the liberty of my people. My soul standeth fast in that liberty in the which God hath made us free.","n":9,"sm":"Ma o lenei, ua e aoaiina a’u i lau tusi, ae ua le afaina lea; ou te le o ita, a ua ou olioli i le telē o lou loto. O a’u, o Paorana, ou te le saili mo le pule, na’o lo’u fia tausi i lo’u nofoa-faamasino ina ia mafai ona ou faasaoina aia ma le saolotoga o o’u tagata. Ua tumau mausali pea lo’u agaga i lena saolotoga ua faasaolotoina ai i tatou e le Atua.","w":[{"en":"and","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Now","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"aoaiina"},{"en":"you have rebuked me","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"lau"},{"en":"in your epistle,","sm":"tusi,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ae"},{"en":"and only","sm":"ua"},{"en":"not","sm":"le"},{"en":"matters","sm":"afaina"},{"en":"that","sm":"lea;"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"not","sm":"le"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"angry","sm":"ita,"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"but do rejoice","sm":"olioli"},{"en":"to","sm":"i"},{"en":"the","sm":"le"},{"en":"greatness","sm":"telē"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lou"},{"en":"your heart.","sm":"loto."},{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"I am","sm":"a’u,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Pahoran,","sm":"Paorana,"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"not","sm":"le"},{"en":"seek,","sm":"saili"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"power","sm":"pule,"},{"en":"·","sm":"na’o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"fia"},{"en":"only my wish to keep","sm":"tausi"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"my judgment-seat","sm":"nofoa-faamasino"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{